translate the question "List all song names by singers above the average age." into SPARQL.

result:
```sparql
PREFIX : <http://valuenet/ontop/>

SELECT ?song_name
WHERE {
  {
    SELECT (AVG(?age) AS ?average_age)
    WHERE {
      ?singer a :singer ;
              :singer\#age ?age .
    }
  }
  ?singer a :singer ;
          :singer\#age ?age ;
          :singer\#song_name ?song_name .
  FILTER(?age > ?average_age)
}
```

