translate the question "Show countries where a singer above age 40 and a singer below 30 are from." into SPARQL.

result:
```sparql
PREFIX : <http://valuenet/ontop/>

SELECT DISTINCT ?country
WHERE {
  {
    ?singer1 a :singer ;
             :singer\#age ?age1 ;
             :singer\#country ?country .
    FILTER(?age1 > 40)
  }
  UNION
  {
    ?singer2 a :singer ;
             :singer\#age ?age2 ;
             :singer\#country ?country .
    FILTER(?age2 < 30)
  }
}
```

